   "text": "OD-B10-S02 on the rig desk. Each actor is a Subnet with one Minifig Rig: its generated choreography comes from assets/rig/OD-B10-S02/<actor>.json; the director's layer is the rig's own props (an offset per servo, a weight per body part), keyed in the Timeline against the Voice Track. Preview headless: cascade run rig-OD-B10-S02.cascade --frames 1-419 --fps 12. Export: node tools/rig_export.mjs OD-B10-S02."
